  "title": "Hanover Bancorp, Inc. Appoints Kevin O’Connor President",
  "summary": "MINEOLA, NY – July 20, 2026 — Hanover Bancorp, Inc. (NASDAQ: HNVR) (“the Company”)and Hanover Community Bank (the “Bank”), announced that they have named KevinO’Connor to the position of President of the Company and the Bank effective July 27, 2026.In this role, Mr. O’Connor will fuel expansion and regional growth throughout the Long Islandmarket by...",
